<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This Coding Standards & Engineering Playbook defines the conventions we follow across the Gamified Finance Capstone Project to keep the codebase consistent, readable, testable, and secure. A shared standard reduces technical debt, makes reviews objective, speeds up onboarding, and lets the team ship changes with confidence.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
148 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Scope. These standards apply to every part of the system: the web frontend \(React + Tailwind\), the primary backend APIs \(Node/Express, TypeScript\), the AI microservice \(FastAPI, Python\), middleware, scripts, database migrations \(PostgreSQL\), caching \(Redis\), and all tests and CI/CD workflows.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
